The bounded HTTP body reader is adapted from sailry-code commit 67ae9fa0,
services/pairing-relay/src/worker.ts. Its GNU GPL version 3 license is preserved
verbatim in LICENSE. The old multi-step SPAKE2 mailbox is not included.
The current service implements the user-approved six-digit, sixty-second,
single-use ticket exchange. Rust Link owns device pairing and persistent trust.
